{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"boothcheck API","version":"1.4.0","description":"Read-only derived data from SEC filings: what a stock price is betting on (implied growth, duration, margin), research report sections, segment snapshots, peer cohorts, a management guidance track record, risk-factor additions, insider and holder fact registers, and the cross-company analyst desk (one table and deterministic brief across 2 to 25 names, available to signed-in Founding Access accounts). No Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating. Informational and research purposes only.","termsOfService":"https://boothcheck.com/api-terms","contact":{"url":"https://boothcheck.com/developers"}},"servers":[{"url":"https://boothcheck.com/api/v1"}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"apiKey":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","description":"API key (bck_...). Create one from any signed-in Founding Access account at https://boothcheck.com/settings."}}},"paths":{"/priced-in":{"get":{"operationId":"whats_priced_in","summary":"What's priced into a stock","description":"Invert a US stock's current price into the bet it implies: the operating-income growth rate, how many years it must be sustained, and (where the route holds one as an input) the terminal operating margin assumption, versus what the company has actually delivered (from SEC EDGAR filings, reverse-DCF). boothcheck does not return a Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or buy/sell rating — it shows what the price assumes so the user can judge the bet. Covers about 2,000 US tickers.","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/priced-in/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"whats_priced_in_by_path","summary":"What's priced into a stock","description":"Invert a US stock's current price into the bet it implies: the operating-income growth rate, how many years it must be sustained, and (where the route holds one as an input) the terminal operating margin assumption, versus what the company has actually delivered (from SEC EDGAR filings, reverse-DCF). boothcheck does not return a Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or buy/sell rating — it shows what the price assumes so the user can judge the bet. Covers about 2,000 US tickers.","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/most-stretched":{"get":{"operationId":"most_stretched","summary":"Most stretched bets","description":"Rank US stocks by how much growth is already baked into their price (implied operating-income growth from a reverse-DCF read of the current price). Returns the top N with the growth and duration each price assumes (plus any held margin input). Not a sell list — a ranking of where the bar to clear is highest.","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"How many names to return (1-20, default 8)"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/compare-priced-in":{"get":{"operationId":"compare_priced_in","summary":"Compare what two prices assume","description":"Side-by-side of what two US stock prices are each betting on: implied growth and duration (plus any held margin input) from a reverse-DCF inversion of each price. No Boothcheck house fair value or rating — a comparison of the assumptions embedded in the two prices.","parameters":[{"name":"tickerA","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"First US ticker, e.g. AMD"},{"name":"tickerB","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Second US ticker, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/filing-search":{"get":{"operationId":"search_filings","summary":"Search a company filing","description":"Semantic vector search inside one company's latest annual report (10-K/20-F/40-F) or latest quarterly report (10-Q), identical to the search on the live stock page. Use this whenever the user asks what a company's filing says about a topic. Start with source semantic; if no indexed passage exists the tool automatically returns clearly labeled SEC EDGAR full-text filing-level results. Cite the returned SEC link and never claim an absent passage was found. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker, e.g. AAPL"},{"name":"query","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Natural-language filing question, up to 200 characters"},{"name":"scope","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Latest annual report (default) or latest 10-Q"},{"name":"source","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Vector passage search (default) or direct SEC full-text search"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/filing-search/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"search_filings_by_path","summary":"Search a company filing","description":"Semantic vector search inside one company's latest annual report (10-K/20-F/40-F) or latest quarterly report (10-Q), identical to the search on the live stock page. Use this whenever the user asks what a company's filing says about a topic. Start with source semantic; if no indexed passage exists the tool automatically returns clearly labeled SEC EDGAR full-text filing-level results. Cite the returned SEC link and never claim an absent passage was found. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"query","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Natural-language filing question, up to 200 characters"},{"name":"scope","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Latest annual report (default) or latest 10-Q"},{"name":"source","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Vector passage search (default) or direct SEC full-text search"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/filing-discovery":{"get":{"operationId":"discover_filings","summary":"Discover companies across filings","description":"Cross-universe semantic vector search over companies' latest indexed annual filings, identical to Discover across filings on the Research page. Use it for questions such as which companies disclose China demand exposure, a particular supply constraint, or a named risk. It ranks issuers by their best matching filing passage and returns the SEC citation; it is discovery, not an exhaustive absence test. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"query","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Natural-language disclosure to find, up to 200 characters"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/filings":{"get":{"operationId":"list_filings","summary":"List a company's SEC filings","description":"List and filter the complete SEC filing history for one ticker, the same inventory used by Boothcheck's SEC Filings inspector. Use this before requesting an exact filing or when the user asks for recent 10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, Form 4, proxy, registration, or older filings. Returns accession numbers and primary-document links; do not guess an accession. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker, e.g. AAPL"},{"name":"form","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Optional exact SEC form filter, e.g. 10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, 4, DEF 14A"},{"name":"year","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Optional filing year filter"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Maximum filings returned (default 25, max 100)"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/filings/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"list_filings_by_path","summary":"List a company's SEC filings","description":"List and filter the complete SEC filing history for one ticker, the same inventory used by Boothcheck's SEC Filings inspector. Use this before requesting an exact filing or when the user asks for recent 10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, Form 4, proxy, registration, or older filings. Returns accession numbers and primary-document links; do not guess an accession. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"form","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Optional exact SEC form filter, e.g. 10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, 4, DEF 14A"},{"name":"year","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Optional filing year filter"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Maximum filings returned (default 25, max 100)"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/coverage":{"get":{"operationId":"list_coverage","summary":"Coverage list","description":"The honest inventory of what boothcheck currently solves: every US ticker with a live implied-expectations record, with the resolution level each was solved at (whole-company, segment, financials, REIT, and kin). Paginated at 100.","parameters":[{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Page number, 1-based (100 tickers per page)"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/report-summary":{"get":{"operationId":"get_report_summary","summary":"Report summary","description":"The bullet takeaways of a boothcheck narrative research report plus which sections exist. Public reports are summarized keylessly; a signed-in Founding Access account key opens the full cached library. Never a fair value, target, or rating.","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/report-summary/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_report_summary_by_path","summary":"Report summary","description":"The bullet takeaways of a boothcheck narrative research report plus which sections exist. Public reports are summarized keylessly; a signed-in Founding Access account key opens the full cached library. Never a fair value, target, or rating.","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/report":{"get":{"operationId":"get_report","summary":"Full narrative report","description":"The full boothcheck narrative research report for a covered US ticker: VALUATION, BULL_CASE, BEAR_CASE, BULLET_TAKEAWAYS, and CATALYSTS sections, written against the implied-expectations engine. No Boothcheck house fair value, target, or rating — the report describes what the price assumes and what has to go right or wrong. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/report/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_report_by_path","summary":"Full narrative report","description":"The full boothcheck narrative research report for a covered US ticker: VALUATION, BULL_CASE, BEAR_CASE, BULLET_TAKEAWAYS, and CATALYSTS sections, written against the implied-expectations engine. No Boothcheck house fair value, target, or rating — the report describes what the price assumes and what has to go right or wrong. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/iee-record":{"get":{"operationId":"get_iee_record","summary":"Implied-expectations record","description":"The full structured inversion record behind boothcheck's priced-in read: resolution level, solved variable(s) (implied growth / duration / ROE / AFFO or FFO growth per route), held parameters, discount basis, sensitivity, and the plausibility panel measuring how rare the priced-in assumption is against delivered history. The as-of price the solve was pinned to is stamped. No Boothcheck house fair value or target. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/iee-record/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_iee_record_by_path","summary":"Implied-expectations record","description":"The full structured inversion record behind boothcheck's priced-in read: resolution level, solved variable(s) (implied growth / duration / ROE / AFFO or FFO growth per route), held parameters, discount basis, sensitivity, and the plausibility panel measuring how rare the priced-in assumption is against delivered history. The as-of price the solve was pinned to is stamped. No Boothcheck house fair value or target. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/segments":{"get":{"operationId":"get_segments","summary":"Segment snapshot","description":"The clean reportable-segment snapshot for a US ticker, extracted from its latest 10-K segment note (ASC 280) and passed through the deny-list guard: segment names, revenue, operating income where disclosed, and whether the split is geographic. Source: SEC EDGAR. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/segments/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_segments_by_path","summary":"Segment snapshot","description":"The clean reportable-segment snapshot for a US ticker, extracted from its latest 10-K segment note (ASC 280) and passed through the deny-list guard: segment names, revenue, operating income where disclosed, and whether the split is geographic. Source: SEC EDGAR. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/peer-cohort":{"get":{"operationId":"get_peer_cohort","summary":"Peer cohort","description":"The peer cohorts boothcheck compares a US ticker against, per business segment: cohort members with how each cohort was matched (registry / semantic / curated). Cohort-level multiple medians are not served — they are computed inside the engine per valuation line, not stored as standalone facts. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/peer-cohort/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_peer_cohort_by_path","summary":"Peer cohort","description":"The peer cohorts boothcheck compares a US ticker against, per business segment: cohort members with how each cohort was matched (registry / semantic / curated). Cohort-level multiple medians are not served — they are computed inside the engine per valuation line, not stored as standalone facts. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/guidance-ledger":{"get":{"operationId":"get_guidance_ledger","summary":"Management guidance ledger","description":"Management guidance behavior for a US ticker from 8-K filings: how often management raised, cut, initiated, withdrew, or reaffirmed guidance, with the per-year history and scored delivery record available to signed-in Founding Access accounts. Facts about management behavior, never a rating. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/guidance-ledger/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_guidance_ledger_by_path","summary":"Management guidance ledger","description":"Management guidance behavior for a US ticker from 8-K filings: how often management raised, cut, initiated, withdrew, or reaffirmed guidance, with the per-year history and scored delivery record available to signed-in Founding Access accounts. Facts about management behavior, never a rating. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/risk-factor-deltas":{"get":{"operationId":"get_risk_factor_deltas","summary":"Risk-factor additions","description":"Risk factors ADDED to a US company's latest 10-K versus the prior year — the new-worry list management itself wrote, extracted from Item 1A heading diffs. Additions only; verbatim headings. Extraction is boundary-hardened but heading-based, so occasional noise survives (the coverage note says so). Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/risk-factor-deltas/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_risk_factor_deltas_by_path","summary":"Risk-factor additions","description":"Risk factors ADDED to a US company's latest 10-K versus the prior year — the new-worry list management itself wrote, extracted from Item 1A heading diffs. Additions only; verbatim headings. Extraction is boundary-hardened but heading-based, so occasional noise survives (the coverage note says so). Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/insider-signals":{"get":{"operationId":"get_insider_signals","summary":"Insider register","description":"The insider register for a US ticker built from the SEC's quarterly Forms 3/4/5 insider datasets (asOf gives the build date): officers and directors, their reported stakes, when each stake was last reported, and their open-market transaction counts since the register's start (countsSince): non-plan buys and all sales, sales under a 10b5-1 plan included. The counts start at countsSince; they are not all-time totals. Clean filed facts only — no performance claims, no signals-as-recommendations. For each recent trade with its 10b5-1 plan context, use get_insider_activity. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/insider-signals/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_insider_signals_by_path","summary":"Insider register","description":"The insider register for a US ticker built from the SEC's quarterly Forms 3/4/5 insider datasets (asOf gives the build date): officers and directors, their reported stakes, when each stake was last reported, and their open-market transaction counts since the register's start (countsSince): non-plan buys and all sales, sales under a 10b5-1 plan included. The counts start at countsSince; they are not all-time totals. Clean filed facts only — no performance claims, no signals-as-recommendations. For each recent trade with its 10b5-1 plan context, use get_insider_activity. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/insider-activity":{"get":{"operationId":"get_insider_activity","summary":"Insider trades with their 10b5-1 plan context","description":"Recent insider trades for a US ticker from SEC Form 4 filings, kept current from EDGAR's daily index, each with its filed context: open-market or plan trade, the 10b5-1 plan it ran under and that plan's adoption date and days since adoption (from the Form 4 footnotes and the issuer's Item 408 disclosure), trades so far under the same plan and the share of the plan's disclosed aggregate used, percent of the insider's direct holding, exercise-and-sell, late or amended filing, other insiders trading within 30 days, and whether this insider traded in the same month in prior years. Also returns the issuer's disclosed trading arrangements and the window of filings read. Filed facts only; never a signal, score or recommendation. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Trades dated within this many days (default 90)"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/insider-activity/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_insider_activity_by_path","summary":"Insider trades with their 10b5-1 plan context","description":"Recent insider trades for a US ticker from SEC Form 4 filings, kept current from EDGAR's daily index, each with its filed context: open-market or plan trade, the 10b5-1 plan it ran under and that plan's adoption date and days since adoption (from the Form 4 footnotes and the issuer's Item 408 disclosure), trades so far under the same plan and the share of the plan's disclosed aggregate used, percent of the insider's direct holding, exercise-and-sell, late or amended filing, other insiders trading within 30 days, and whether this insider traded in the same month in prior years. Also returns the issuer's disclosed trading arrangements and the window of filings read. Filed facts only; never a signal, score or recommendation. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Trades dated within this many days (default 90)"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/insider-plans":{"get":{"operationId":"get_insider_plans","summary":"10b5-1 trading plans and the trades under them","description":"Plan-level view of the Rule 10b5-1 and non-Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangements a US issuer disclosed under Item 408(a) of Regulation S-K (10-Q/10-K, since mid 2023): one row per adopted plan with the person, title, adoption date, expiration, duration, aggregate shares available, any later termination, and the Form 4 trades linked to it (count, shares, value, first and last trade dates, days from adoption to first trade, share of the disclosed aggregate used). Trades link only on a matching footnoted adoption date or the single plan live on the trade date. Filed facts only; never a signal, score or recommendation. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/insider-plans/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_insider_plans_by_path","summary":"10b5-1 trading plans and the trades under them","description":"Plan-level view of the Rule 10b5-1 and non-Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangements a US issuer disclosed under Item 408(a) of Regulation S-K (10-Q/10-K, since mid 2023): one row per adopted plan with the person, title, adoption date, expiration, duration, aggregate shares available, any later termination, and the Form 4 trades linked to it (count, shares, value, first and last trade dates, days from adoption to first trade, share of the disclosed aggregate used). Trades link only on a matching footnoted adoption date or the single plan live on the trade date. Filed facts only; never a signal, score or recommendation. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/dilution-facts":{"get":{"operationId":"get_dilution_facts","summary":"Share issuance capacity (filed facts)","description":"Can this company issue new shares? Filed facts from SEC EDGAR for a US ticker: shelf registrations (S-3/F-3, incl. automatic shelves) with effective date, three-year mark (Rule 415(a)(5)) and status; the 424B prospectus supplements of the last 24 months (counts for all, the newest 40 listed), each linked to its registration by EDGAR's own file number where that registration is on file, with what the newest covers say is offered (equity, debt, convertible, at-the-market program, resale, headline amount) quoted from the filing; other share registrations (S-1, S-4, S-8); 8-K items 3.02 and 5.03; the as-filed cover-page share count and its 1- and 3-year change (split-like steps flagged); authorized versus outstanding shares; and reported cash against trailing operating cash flow. Never a dilution score, label or forecast. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. AAOI"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/dilution-facts/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_dilution_facts_by_path","summary":"Share issuance capacity (filed facts)","description":"Can this company issue new shares? Filed facts from SEC EDGAR for a US ticker: shelf registrations (S-3/F-3, incl. automatic shelves) with effective date, three-year mark (Rule 415(a)(5)) and status; the 424B prospectus supplements of the last 24 months (counts for all, the newest 40 listed), each linked to its registration by EDGAR's own file number where that registration is on file, with what the newest covers say is offered (equity, debt, convertible, at-the-market program, resale, headline amount) quoted from the filing; other share registrations (S-1, S-4, S-8); 8-K items 3.02 and 5.03; the as-filed cover-page share count and its 1- and 3-year change (split-like steps flagged); authorized versus outstanding shares; and reported cash against trailing operating cash flow. Never a dilution score, label or forecast. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/share-count-history":{"get":{"operationId":"get_share_count_history","summary":"As-filed share count history","description":"The cover-page shares-outstanding count a US company reported on each 10-K/10-Q/20-F (dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding) as filed: the count, its own as-of date, the filing date, form and accession, newest first, with steps whose ratio matches a common split ratio flagged. Point-in-time: each row is what that filing said, never restated. Multi-class issuers that tag counts per class may have no rows. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. AAPL"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/share-count-history/{ticker}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_share_count_history_by_path","summary":"As-filed share count history","description":"The cover-page shares-outstanding count a US company reported on each 10-K/10-Q/20-F (dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding) as filed: the count, its own as-of date, the filing date, form and accession, newest first, with steps whose ratio matches a common split ratio flagged. Point-in-time: each row is what that filing said, never restated. Multi-class issuers that tag counts per class may have no rows. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US ticker symbol."},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}},"/holders":{"get":{"operationId":"get_holders","summary":"13F holders register","description":"The current institutional holders register for a US ticker from 13F filings: fund families holding the name, aggregate percent of shares out, concentration (top-10, focused holders), positions opened and closed in the latest quarter, and notable managers. Facts as filed — no performance framing. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"US stock ticker symbol, e.g. NVDA"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"40