target, rating, or ranking appears. Authenticated account access; paid-mode packaging is documented separately. Requires a signed-in Founding Access account API key (Authorization: Bearer bck_...).","parameters":[{"name":"tickers","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Comma-separated US tickers, 2 to 25 (e.g. NVDA,AMD,INTC)"},{"name":"setId","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"A saved company-set id (acs_...) belonging to your account, instead of tickers"},{"name":"format","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"],"default":"json"},"description":"Response format. CSV requires a signed-in Founding Access account key."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Structured result. Every payload carries an informational-purposes disclaimer; no Boothcheck house fair value, price target, or rating."},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key for a keyed endpoint."},"404":{"description":"Ticker not covered or no data for this surface."},"429":{"description":"Rate limit reached for the key tier."}}}}}}